TICKET-105: Digest API + scheduled generation

Priority: P0 · Estimate: 3 pts · Depends on: 104
`GET /v1/digest` returns today's digest; Cloud Scheduler triggers generation every morning (e.g., 6:30 AM ET) so the app opens to a pre-built digest instantly.

Tasks

- Cloud Scheduler → Pub/Sub → digest generation job (idempotent; safe to re-run)
- Digest document in Firestore: `{date, userId, sections[], generatedAt, emailCount}`
- API versioned under `/v1/` from day one
- ETag/`If-None-Match` support so the app skips downloads when nothing changed

Acceptance criteria

- App fetch of a pre-generated digest returns in < 300ms p95
- Re-running the job for the same day doesn't duplicate or double-bill
- Missed-schedule fallback: app can request on-demand generation
